  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Victims assistance and explosive ordnance risk education in Laos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lessons learnt and best practices of victims assistance (VA) and Explosive ordnance risk education (EORE) from Lao PDR is promoted at regional and international level. Coordination and understanding of VA integrated approaches and innovative behavioural approaches are reinforced through the development of coordination mechanisms and national standards.</narrative>
  </description>
